  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kommunalt samarbete inom plan- och milj&#xF6;omr o lokal f&#xF6;rvaltn. G&#xE4;ller l&#xE4;nder d&#xE4;r Sida har samarbavtal och KTS-l&#xE4;nder. Fr&#xE4;mst engelspr&#xE5;kiga l&#xE4;nder. SK sk&#xF6;ter adm, info etc enl avtal m Sida.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Twinning co-operation in the planning and environmental sectors and local adminstration. In Sida&apos;s programme countries as well as KTS-countries. Mainly for english speaking countries. SK administrates the programme and is responsible for reporting back to Sida.</narrative>
  </description>
